          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Metric exchange contracts</h3>
          <p class="text-ink/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Each sharing arrangement is formalised with a defined set of metrics, an access level, a date range, and a counterparty. Nothing gets shared without a contract in place.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-warm border border-ink/8 rounded-2xl p-6">
