          <p class="text-ink/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Connected to your Semantic Nexus, the metrics your partners see are always current. No manual refreshes, no out-of-date spreadsheets sent by email.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-warm border border-ink/8 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M17 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H5a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2"/><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M23 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87"/><path d="M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="font-bold text-ink mb-2">Per-party access control</h3>
          <p class="text-ink/55 text-sm leading-relaxed">Your investor sees revenue and growth. Your supply chain partner sees delivery and operations. Your regulator sees compliance metrics. Each party only sees what you've explicitly approved.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-warm border border-ink/8 rounded-2xl p-6">
          <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-brand-100 text-brand-600 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center mb-4">
